;; Declared root translations for paths embedded in preserved evidence.
;;
;; Artifacts under references/ are append-only records and are never rewritten,
;; so stale roots are corrected at READ time by these rules instead. Order
;; matters: the first matching :from wins, so put longer prefixes first.
;;
;; Every rule carries a :basis. A translation without a recorded reason is a
;; guess, and a guess that silently succeeds is the failure mode this whole
;; mechanism exists to prevent.
{:rules
 [{:from "/home/err/devel/Music/fork-tales"
   :to   "/home/err/Music/fork-tales"
   :basis "Artifacts predate the ~/Music relocation. devel/Music/fork-tales does exist but holds one unrelated file, so the stale path resolves to a decoy rather than erroring — observed 2026-07-27."}
  {:from "/home/err/devel/Music/heresy_between"
   :to   "/home/err/Music/heresy_between"
   :basis "Same relocation; source Suno renders and metadata live under ~/Music."}]}
